Step 1 Install Terraform
-https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform
-Download and unzip the downloaded terraform file.
-Copy the 'terraform.exe' file.
-Create a folder in your C drive and title it 'terraform'.
-Paste the 'terraform.exe' file into the 'terraform' folder you just created.

-For Windows 11 search: view advanced system settings

-Open Environment Variables:

  Search for "environment variables" in the Windows Start menu.

  Select "Edit the system environment variables."

  In the System Properties window, click "Environment Variables..."

  Edit Path Variable:

  Under "System variables" (or "User variables" for your specific user), find the "Path" variable and click "Edit..."

  In the "Edit environment variable" window, click "New."

-Paste the terraform folder into the PATH C:\terraform

